# ─── Rust workspace ───
/target/
**/*.rs.bk
# Cargo.lock IS committed — this workspace ships binaries.

# ─── Nix ───
/result
/result-*
.direnv/
# flake.lock IS committed (pins nixpkgs). infra/pkgs build outputs are ./result symlinks (ignored above).

# ─── Secrets (age / sops) ───
# Encrypted files are committed (ciphertext). Private keys and decrypted material never are.
# infra/secrets/ has its own deny-all allowlist .gitignore for that directory.
*.age
age.key
keys.txt
*.plain.yaml
*.dec.yaml
*.decrypted
.sops-tmp/

# ─── Copyrighted / user-supplied inputs (never commit) ───
*.nes
*.sav
*.savestate

# ─── baud run artifacts ───
/out/
/runs/
*.tape
*.journal
*.y4m
*.qoi

# ─── SQLite dev databases ───
*.sqlite
*.sqlite-shm
*.sqlite-wal

# ─── OS / editors ───
.DS_Store
*.swp
*~
.idea/
.vscode/
.zed/
